{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2019-11-05 22:30:00', 'title': 'MARUBENI CORPORATION (TSE:8002) AND MIZUHO LEASING COMPANY, LIMITED (TSE:8425) ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE 71.2% STAKE IN AIRCASTLE LIMITED (NYSE:AYR) FROM BLACKROCK, INC. (NYSE:BLK), THE VANGUARD GROUP, INC., DIMENSIONAL FUND ADVISORS L.P., AND LSV ASSET MANAGEMENT FOR $1.9 BILLION.', 'text': "MARUBENI CORPORATION (TSE:8002) AND MIZUHO LEASING COMPANY, LIMITED (TSE:8425) ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE 71.2% STAKE IN AIRCASTLE LIMITED (NYSE:AYR) FROM BLACKROCK, INC. (NYSE:BLK), THE VANGUARD GROUP, INC., DIMENSIONAL FUND ADVISORS L.P., AND LSV ASSET MANAGEMENT FOR $1.9 BILLION ON NOVEMBER 5, 2019. AIRCASTLE SHAREHOLDERS WILL RECEIVE $32 IN CASH FOR EACH COMMON SHARE OF AIRCASTLE OTHER THAN SHARES ALREADY OWNED BY MARUBENI AND ITS AFFILIATES, REPRESENTING A TOTAL VALUATION OF $2.4 BILLION, OR $7.4 BILLION INCLUDING DEBT OBLIGATIONS TO BE ASSUMED OR REFINANCED NET OF CASH. ON COMPLETION, ALL OF AIRCASTLE'S SHARES WILL BE DELISTED. MARUBENI WILL CONTINUE TO PROVIDE SUPPORT TO AIRCASTLE AS A STRATEGIC PARTNER TO REINFORCE AIRCASTLE’S BUSINESS PLATFORM. AIRCASTLE WILL PAY A TERMINATION FEE OF $73.5 MILLION IN CASE OF MERGER TERMINATION.\n\nTHE TRANSACTION IS SUBJECT TO CUSTOMARY CLOSING CONDITIONS, INCLUDING APPROVAL BY AIRCASTLE'S SHAREHOLDERS AND RECEIPT OF CERTAIN REGULATORY APPROVALS, AND MARUBENI HAS APPROVED THE TRANSACTION. THE TRANSACTION IS SUBJECT TO THE EXPIRATION OR EARLY TERMINATION OF THE WAITING PERIOD APPLICABLE TO THE CONSUMMATION OF THE MERGER UNDER THE HART-SCOTT-RODINO ANTITRUST IMPROVEMENTS ACT OF 1976, AS AMENDED. MARUBENI AND MIZUHO BOARD, AND AIRCASTLE’S BOARD HAVE APPROVED THE MERGER AGREEMENT. MARUBENI AND MIZUHO SHAREHOLDERS HAVE ALSO APPROVED THE DEAL. THE DEAL IS EXPECTED TO CLOSE IN THE FIRST HALF OF 2020. AS OF NOVEMBER 13, 2019, THE DEAL IS EXPECTED TO CLOSE BY THE END OF JUNE 2020.\n\nCITIGROUP GLOBAL MARKETS INC. ACTED AS THE FINANCIAL ADVISOR AND JOSEPH A. COCO AND THOMAS W. GREENBERG OF SKADDEN, ARPS, SLATE, MEAGHER & FLOM LLP AND JASON PINEY OF CONYERS DILL & PEARMAN ACTED AS THE LEGAL ADVISORS TO AIRCASTLE LIMITED. JPMORGAN CHASE & CO. ACTED AS FINANCIAL ADVISOR TO MARUBENI CORPORATION AND MIZUHO LEASING COMPANY, LIMITED. JOHN A. HEALY OF CLIFFORD CHANCE US LLP AND JUN USAMI AND NELS HANSEN OF WHITE & CASE LLP ACTED AS LEGAL ADVISORS TO MARUBENI CORPORATION AND MIZUHO LEASING COMPANY.\n"}